| t.TipePenanganan                         |
| spasi		                           |
|  t.TglInput         :__________________  |
|  t.NipPengaju       :__________________  |
|  t.Nama             :__________________  |
|  t.TipePenanganan   :_________________   |
|  t.Polres           :_________________   |
